---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header";
import Footer from "../components/Footer";
---

<Layout 
	title="Terms of Service | deBackground"
	description="Review the terms of service for deBackground. Free for personal and commercial use with a commitment to privacy."
>
	<main class="min-h-screen bg-background flex flex-col pt-24">
		<Header client:load />
		
		<div class="grow pb-24 px-6 md:px-8">
			<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-8">
				<a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition-colors group">
					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="group-hover:-translate-x-1 transition-transform"><path d="m12 19-7-7 7-7"/><path d="M19 12H5"/></svg>
					Back to Home
				</a>

				<header class="space-y-4">
					<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">Terms of Service</h1>
					<p class="text-muted-foreground">Last updated: January 2026</p>
				</header>

				<section class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
					<div class="space-y-4">
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
						<p>
							By using deBackground, you agree to these terms. Because we don't have accounts, 
							your agreement is implied by your continued use of the tool.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="space-y-4">
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">2. License & Usage</h2>
						<p>
							deBackground is free to use for both personal and commercial projects. You own 100% of the 
							rights to the images you process. We do not claim any ownership over your content.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="space-y-4">
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">3. No Warranty</h2>
						<p>
							The tool is provided "as is". While we use state-of-the-art AI, we cannot guarantee 
							perfect results for every image. We are not liable for any issues arising from the 
							use of the processed images.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="space-y-4">
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">4. Acceptable Use</h2>
						<p>
							You agree not to use this tool for any illegal purposes or to process content 
							that violates others' rights.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="space-y-4">
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">5. Changes to Tool</h2>
						<p>
							We reserve the right to modify or discontinue any part of the tool without notice.
						</p>
					</div>
				</section>
			</div>
		</div>

		<Footer />
	</main>
</Layout>
